  "title": "United Bank Promotes Hannah Gurtis to Charleston Market President",
  "summary": "CHARLESTON, SC – United Bank recently promoted Hannah Gurtis to president of its Charleston Market. In this role, Gurtis will lead strategic efforts to drive commercial and retail production, while ensuring the profitability and sustained growth of the market. Additionally, Gurtis will play a pivotal leadership role in managing public relations efforts in Charleston, while also representing United Bank in the community through active participation in civic affairs and professional organizations.",
